  {
   "id": "is.workflow.actions.comment",
   "p": {
    "WFCommentActionText": "Log-PageShot: a URL in, a screenshot of it in Safari committed to shortcuts/shots/ in web-tools-private.\n\nCan run as URL:\nshortcuts://run-shortcut?name=Log-PageShot&input=text&text=<the page URL>\n\nThe Show Web View sheet is gone from this chain and cannot come back. Probe-SheetBlocks measured a 33-second gap across the sheet on 2026-09-09 (before=23:18:49 after=23:19:22), so the run resumes only when the sheet is dismissed. Nothing can photograph a sheet it is stalled behind, and no alert or notification can gate the shutter from back there either. Safari is the only route to a live page.\n\nTwo shots, at 5 and 12 seconds, arriving side by side as one image. A single instant is a bet on how fast the page loads; two cover a fast page and a slow one for one extra card and one commit. The alert says to leave the phone alone and the notification says when it is safe to pick it up again, so the reader is never guessing whether it is still working."
   }
  },
